    "show_share": true,
    "description": "When Dr Shahzadi Resham talks about her work, her words carry both warmth and purpose. Her demeanor reflects years of dedication to paediatric care, where compassion and clinical excellence intertwine seamlessly. Recently, her approach to healing earned her The Spirit of Planetree Award, an international recognition celebrating individuals who embody the essence of person-centred care.",
